OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMorning fog patches soon
OL,6,Fclearing to leave a fine day, with
OL,7,Fplenty of sunny spells. Perhaps some
OL,8,Fcloudier moments developing at times,
OL,9,Fwith the odd light shower possible.
OL,10,FFeeling pleasantly warm in the
OL,11,Fsunshine, with an easterly breeze
OL,12,Fdeveloping.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FA fine evening, then dry
OL,15,Fovernight with lengthy clear spells.
OL,16,FBreezy over the hills and along the
OL,17,Fcoast. Not quite as chilly as recent
OL,18,Fnights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
